    {
      "type": "table",
      "anchor": null,
      "rows": [
        {
          "row": 0,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2. The following was identified as a result of the inspection:",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": true,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 1,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): A review of the technical documentation revealed the following: declarations and certificates of conformity were translated incorrectly; in the quality certificates, the translation of the stainless steel grade was incorrect, and the translation of the signatory’s name and the seal/stamp was missing; in the certificate of conformity, the translation of the product name was incorrect. /В ходе проверки технической документации выявлено: произведен некорректный перевод деклараций, сертификатов соответствия; в паспортах качества неверен перевод марки нержавеющей стали, отсутствует перевод подписанта паспорта, печати/штампа; в паспорте на отвод неверно сделан перевод наименования товара.",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 2,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments): A visual inspection revealed metal corrosion on all tees, 108x4–57x3 adapters, and DN50 steel weld-on flanges. /В ходе визуального осмотра обнаружена коррозия металла на всех тройниках, переходах 108х4-57х3 и фланцах стальных приварных Ду50.",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 3,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 4,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.4. Nonconformities (none, or give comments, Nonconformity Report no.): NONE",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 5,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "Conclusion:MATERIALS ARE                         ☐ ACCEPTED                          ☒ REJECTED",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 6,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "Attachments:1. Passport / Паспорт № 3364 dated 15.08.2025 (1 page);2. Passport / Паспорт № НФНФ-009796/10 dated 14.08.2025 (1 page);3. Passport / Паспорт № ЕК-00004641-RU-1-20-1 dated 27.08.2025 (2 pages);4. Passport / Паспорт № 09/03/28 dated 03.09.2025 (1 page);5. Passport / Паспорт № 09/03/29 dated 03.09.2025 (1 page);6. Passport / Паспорт № 09/10/26 dated 10.09.2025 (1 page);7. Passport / Паспорт № ЕК-00004641-RU-1-12Х18Н10Т-1 dated 27.08.2025 (2 pages);8. Packing list / Упаковочный лист №0909-04/2026 dated 09.04.2026 (5 pages);9. Certificate of conformity / Сертификат соответствия № ЕАЭС RU C-RU.АБ53.В.03442/22 dated 04.02.2022 (6 pages);10. Certificate of conformity / Сертификат соответствия № ЕАЭС RU C-RU.АВ29.В.00089/20 dated 22.09.2020 (3 pages);11. Declaration of conformity/Декларация о соответствии № ЕАЭС N RU Д-RU.АВ29.B.02526/20 dated 01.10.2020 (3 pages);12. Certificate of conformity / Сертификат соответствия № ЕАЭС RU C-RU.НВ73.В.00390/23 dated 20.01.2023 (5 pages);13. Certificate of conformity / Сертификат соответствия № ЕАЭС RU C-RU.АЖ58.В.02474/22 dated 15.03.2022 (3 pages);14. Certificate of conformity/Сертификат соответствия № POCC RU.31621.04ПШН4.ОС.05.С00293 dated 23.06.2025 (2 pages).",
